    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/premier-inn-heathrow-airport-terminal-4/hotel/london-gb.html",
    "name": "Premier Inn Heathrow Airport Terminal 4",
    "detail": "Room : Clean, practical and good. Bed is comfortable, Tea and coffee making facilities adequate, shower was fantastic with hot water and shower head. Down side - No bedroom slippers, no shower cap, no extra toothbrush or toothpaste. Staffs : Everybody were wonderful and helpful. Location : The best part. 10min walk in a covered walkway to Terminal 4, 50min underground train ride to Central London through the Piccadilly Line accessed directly at Terminal 4 train station, and few mins to other Terminals using the free train provided to connect to the rest of Terminals. Ammenities : Trolleys parked at the hotel entrance to be used to carry the bags to the airport terminals. Costa Coffee restaurant for your meals and vending machines for the rest of your daily requirement. You can even walk to Terminal 4 or other Terminals for your meal. ",
